# hypr: two terminals typed into, a floating window moved and resized with Super
# and the pointer, a workspace round trip, the launcher page, a screenshot.
chord super+Return
sleep 1200
chord super+Return
sleep 1200
move 300 300
click left
type echo hello from proscenium
key Return
glide 900 300 300
click left
type ls
key Return
chord super+v
sleep 500
hold super
down left
glide 700 400 400
up left
down right
glide 800 500 400
up right
release super
sleep 500
chord super+2
sleep 600
chord super+1
sleep 600
chord super+d
sleep 2000
type foot
sleep 500
key Print
sleep 1200
key Escape
sleep 500
